# Generated by Cargo
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock

# The Xtensa (ESP32-S3) crates build under their own `esp` toolchain fork
# outside the main workspace (see root Cargo.toml's `exclude`), so each
# has its own target dir the root `/target/` pattern above doesn't reach.
rivet-arch-xtensa/target/
rivet-bsp-esp32s3/target/
examples/esp32s3/target/

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# QEMU instruction traces (can reach 100s of MB) and tool state
*.trace
qemu.log
/archive/
/.reasonix/
fuzz/target/
__pycache__/

# Local development log, not part of the shipped repository — referenced
# by source comments throughout this codebase ("plan.md Phase N", "plan.md
# §4.1") purely as historical context for whoever was doing that work at
# the time; see CONTRIBUTING.md for why a fresh clone doesn't have it.
/plan.md

# PulseTrace: a separate, independent project (a companion desktop trace
# viewer for Rivet, its own Cargo workspace/README/history) that lives
# nested in this checkout rather than as a sibling directory — not part of
# the rivet-rtos repository.
/pulsetrace/
